EGG SHOP SALES CALCULATOR - PSEUDOCODE

Name: SHIMIRWA ALDA MICHAELLA
Registration Number: 25/BIT/BU/R/0037
Campus: Bugema Main campus

ALGORITHM:
1. DECLARE variables:
   - eggs_in_stock (integer)
   - eggs_purchased (integer)
   - price_per_egg (integer)
   - amount_paid (integer)
   - total_bill (integer)
   - change (integer)
   - remaining_stock (integer)
   - complete_trays (integer)
   - loose_eggs (integer)

2. DISPLAY "=== LOCAL EGG SHOP SALES CALCULATOR ==="

3. INPUT:
   - READ eggs_in_stock from user
   - READ eggs_purchased from user
   - READ price_per_egg from user
   - READ amount_paid from user

4. CALCULATE:
   - total_bill = eggs_purchased * price_per_egg
   - change = amount_paid - total_bill
   - complete_trays = eggs_purchased / 30
   - loose_eggs = eggs_purchased % 30

5. UPDATE stock:
   - remaining_stock = eggs_in_stock
   - remaining_stock = remaining_stock - eggs_purchased

6. DISPLAY receipt:
   - PRINT header "EGG SHOP RECEIPT"
   - PRINT eggs_purchased
   - PRINT price_per_egg
   - PRINT total_bill
   - PRINT amount_paid
   - PRINT change
   - PRINT complete_trays
   - PRINT loose_eggs
   - PRINT eggs_in_stock
   - PRINT remaining_stock

7. END program
